{"sha": "a2432aacd6bc3153fd849a612bf3b1d3e208c0970560bd2169dfe3a45ce57e04", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  % compound pendulum: plate pivoted at top", "  \\fill[pattern=north east lines] (-0.8,3.4) rectangle (0.8,3.6); \\draw[thick] (-0.8,3.4) -- (0.8,3.4);", "  \\fill (0,3.3) circle (1.6pt);", "  \\begin{scope}[rotate around={-20:(0,3.3)}]", "    \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!12] (-0.5,0.3) rectangle (0.5,3.3);", "    \\fill (0,1.7) circle (1.6pt); \\node[right] at (0.05,1.7) {$G$};", "    \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (0,1.7) -- ++(0,-1.4);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,3.3) -- (0,0.4);", "  \\node[omThm] at (0.75,0.55) {$M\\vect g$};", "  \\draw (0,2.3) arc (-90:-110:1.0); \\node at (-0.3,2.1) {$\\theta$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-0.1) {$T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{J_\\Delta/Mgd}$};", "  % torsion pendulum", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=5.5cm]", "  \\fill[pattern=north east lines] (-0.8,3.4) rectangle (0.8,3.6); \\draw[thick] (-0.8,3.4) -- (0.8,3.4);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,3.4) -- (0,1.6);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick, fill=omDef!12] (0,1.3) ellipse (1.4 and 0.35);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp, thick] (0.9,1.05) arc (-60:30:0.9) node[right] {$\\theta$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-0.1) {$T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{J/C}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % rolling down incline", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=10.2cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (-1.6,0) -- (2.4,0) -- (-1.6,2.2) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[omThm, thick, fill=omThm!10] ($(-0.6,1.65)+(61.2:0.5)$) circle (0.5);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] ($(-0.6,1.65)+(61.2:0.5)$) -- ++(-28.8:1.1) node[below right] {$\\vect v_G$};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0.5,-0.35) {$a = \\dfrac{g\\sin\\alpha}{1 + J/MR^2}$};", "  \\draw (1.6,0) arc (180:151.2:0.8); \\node at (1.35,0.25) {$\\alpha$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三个运动中的刚体：绕支点摆动的复摆", "（重力对转轴的力矩）、扭摆（金属丝的力矩），", "以及无滑动地沿斜面滚下的刚体 ---", "其 $J/MR^2$ 越大，滚动越慢。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[无滑动地沿斜面滚动]\\label{prop:b1:systems-of-points:rollingincline}", "绕其轴的转动惯量为 $J = kMR^2$ 的旋转刚体，", "从倾角为 $\\alpha$ 的斜面上释放后，无滑动地滚下，其加速度为", "\\[", "a = \\frac{g\\sin\\alpha}{1 + k} :", "\\]", "实心球的加速度为 $\\tfrac57 g\\sin\\alpha$，圆盘为 $\\tfrac23 g\\sin\\alpha$，", "细圆环为 $\\tfrac12 g\\sin\\alpha$，均与质量和半径无关。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "能量关系 $Mgh = \\tfrac12 Mv^2(1 + k)$（沿斜面；接触点处的", "静摩擦力不做功），故 $v^2 = 2ah$，其中 $a$ 如上式所示；", "或对 $G$ 用牛顿第二定律，并对 $G$ 用力矩定理，", "设摩擦力为 $f$：$Ma = Mg\\sin\\alpha - f$，$kMR^2\\dot\\omega = fR$，$a = R\\dot\\omega$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}[可变形系统]\\label{rem:b1:systems-of-points:deformable}", "\\index{可变形系统}", "对于非刚性系统，动能定理为", "$\\Delta E_k = W_{\\mathrm{ext}} + W_{\\mathrm{int}}$：内力", "做功（肌肉、弹簧、系统内部的摩擦力）。滑冰者收拢双臂、", "跳水者收紧身体、骑车者站立蹬踏板，都在没有外力做功的情况下", "获得动能——质心", "定理依然成立，能量来自系统内部。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:systems-of-points:1}", "质量分别为 \\qty{2.0}{kg}、\\qty{3.0}{kg} 的物体位于 $x = 0$ 与 $x = \\qty{1.0}{m}$ 处，", "求 $G$ 的位置。地月系统（质量比 $81:1$，", "距离 \\qty{384000}{km}）中，求 $G$ 到地心的距离，", "并与地球半径比较。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:systems-of-points:2}", "质量为 \\qty{4.0}{kg} 的步枪发射质量为 \\qty{10}{g} 的子弹，子弹速率为 \\qty{800}{m/s}。", "求后坐速率；子弹与步枪的动能；", "能量来自何处？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:systems-of-points:3}", "质量为 \\qty{1000}{kg}、速率为 \\qty{20}{m/s} 的汽车与静止的质量为 \\qty{1500}{kg} 的汽车相碰，", "两车粘在一起。求共同速率；损失的动能所占比例。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:systems-of-points:4}", "推导质量为 $M$、长为 $L$ 的均匀细杆", "绕通过一端、与杆垂直的轴，以及绕通过中心、与杆垂直的轴的转动惯量；", "并验证两者之间的惠更斯定理。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:systems-of-points:5}", "求质量与速率相同的匀质圆柱体与圆环滚动时的动能，", "以 $\\tfrac12 Mv^2$ 的倍数表示；哪一个在粗糙水平地面上先停下？", "哪一个沿斜面上升得更高？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:systems-of-points:6}", "求 HCl（$m_{Cl} = 35m_H$）与氢原子（", "$m_p = 1836m_e$）的约化质量；求仅用轻质量计算", "振动或轨道频率时的相对修正。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:systems-of-points:7}", "长为 \\qty{1.0}{m} 的均匀细杆可绕一端自由转动。求微小振动的周期；", "求与之周期相同的单摆的长度；", "求杆上的打击中心（在该点受猛击时，支点处不产生反作用力）", "到支点的距离，并说明它与该单摆长度的关系；", "棒球击球手为什么要寻找这一点？", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}